242
00:17:56,471 --> 00:17:58,524
Read the question, then answer out loud.

243
00:18:03,364 --> 00:18:08,108
A strong answer deals with the deletion in
terms of objects and refs: what a commit

244
00:18:08,148 --> 00:18:12,315
that removes a file adds to the
repository, and what it leaves reachable.

245
00:18:12,355 --> 00:18:17,157
It then gives the response in order and
explains why the first step comes first with

246
00:18:17,197 --> 00:18:19,462
